{
  "version": 8,
  "name": "Atlanta Streets",
  "id": "atlanta-streets",
  "metadata": {
    "peregrine:note": "A base map for riding in a city grid, against the peregrine tilemaker profile (OpenMapTiles). Every road's casing is coloured by how comfortable it is to ride, trails are the strongest line, interstates are drawn as landmarks that cannot be ridden, and sidewalks, parking and lodging wait for close zooms. Written inside the subset in style-readme.md.",
    "peregrine:bike-tiers": "Casing colour by tier: trail (path that admits bicycles) #17803d; signed route (road with bicycle=designated) #2e9e57; quiet (minor, service) #8fb89a; moderate (tertiary) #e0a830; busy (secondary) #e07b39; avoid (primary, trunk) #c8413a; no bicycles (bicycle=no) #7d7884; interstate (motorway) #463f7a. The tiles carry no maxspeed, lanes or cycleway tags, so the tier is the road class; a profile that writes `cycleway` would light the bike-lane layer.",
    "peregrine:palette": "Land #f2efe9, water #a5cbe0, park #bfe0a5, golf #e3e8d3, wood #d3e0c0, building #e2ddd5, parking #e6e3dd, rail #9e9a93, state line #a39bb8."
  },
  "sources": {"openmaptiles": {"type": "vector"}},
  "sprite": "symbols/osm-liberty-topo",
  "layers": [
    {"id": "background", "type": "background",
     "paint": {"background-color": "#f2efe9"}},

    {"id": "wood", "type": "fill", "source-layer": "landcover",
     "filter": ["==", "class", "wood"],
     "paint": {"fill-color": "#d3e0c0"}},
    {"id": "grass", "type": "fill", "source-layer": "landcover", "minzoom": 11,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "class", "grass"], ["!in", "subclass", "park", "golf_course", "recreation_ground", "garden"]],
     "paint": {"fill-color": "#dde9c9"}},
    {"id": "wetland", "type": "fill", "source-layer": "landcover",
     "filter": ["==", "class", "wetland"],
     "paint": {"fill-color": "#d2dcc4"}},
    {"_comment": "Golf is ground, not a destination: a pale fill a step off the land colour, never the park green.",
     "id": "golf-course", "type": "fill", "source-layer": "landcover", "minzoom": 11,
     "filter": ["==", "subclass", "golf_course"],
     "paint": {"fill-color": "#e3e8d3", "fill-outline-color": {"stops": [[11, "#e3e8d3"], [14, "#cdd6b6"]]}}},
    {"id": "nature-reserve", "type": "fill", "source-layer": "park",
     "filter": ["==", "$type", "Polygon"],
     "paint": {"fill-color": "#cfe6b8", "fill-outline-color": "#a9cf8f"}},
    {"_comment": "Parks are the city's landmarks and its quiet routes: the strongest ground colour, outlined once the edge can be told from a street.",
     "id": "park", "type": "fill", "source-layer": "landcover",
     "filter": ["in", "subclass", "park", "recreation_ground", "garden"],
     "paint": {"fill-color": "#bfe0a5", "fill-outline-color": {"stops": [[10, "#bfe0a5"], [13, "#93c47d"]]}}},

    {"id": "cemetery", "type": "fill", "source-layer": "landuse", "minzoom": 11,
     "filter": ["==", "class", "cemetery"],
     "paint": {"fill-color": "#d8e0cc"}},
    {"id": "campus", "type": "fill", "source-layer": "landuse", "minzoom": 12,
     "filter": ["in", "class", "university", "college", "school"],
     "paint": {"fill-color": "#ebe5d8"}},
    {"id": "hospital", "type": "fill", "source-layer": "landuse", "minzoom": 12,
     "filter": ["==", "class", "hospital"],
     "paint": {"fill-color": "#f2e0dc"}},
    {"id": "pitch", "type": "fill", "source-layer": "landuse", "minzoom": 15,
     "filter": ["==", "class", "pitch"],
     "paint": {"fill-color": "#cfe3b6", "fill-outline-color": "#a9c68a"}},
    {"_comment": "Surface lots cover much of the city; drawn only close in, and barely off the land colour.",
     "id": "parking", "type": "fill", "source-layer": "landuse", "minzoom": 15.5,
     "filter": ["==", "class", "parking"],
     "paint": {"fill-color": "#e9e6e0", "fill-outline-color": {"stops": [[15.5, "#e9e6e0"], [17, "#d5d1c9"]]}}},

    {"id": "water", "type": "fill", "source-layer": "water",
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "Polygon"], ["!=", "class", "swimming_pool"]],
     "paint": {"fill-color": "#a5cbe0"}},
    {"id": "pool", "type": "fill", "source-layer": "water", "minzoom": 16,
     "filter": ["==", "class", "swimming_pool"],
     "paint": {"fill-color": "#b8e3ee", "fill-outline-color": "#86bfd1"}},
    {"id": "river", "type": "line", "source-layer": "waterway",
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["in", "class", "river", "canal"], ["!=", "brunnel", "tunnel"]],
     "paint": {"line-color": "#93bdd6",
               "line-width": {"base": 1.4, "stops": [[8, 0.6], [12, 1.4], [16, 4], [19, 8]]}}},
    {"_comment": "Creeks and ditches are thin until they could be mistaken for nothing else.",
     "id": "stream", "type": "line", "source-layer": "waterway", "minzoom": 13,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["!in", "class", "river", "canal"], ["!=", "brunnel", "tunnel"]],
     "paint": {"line-color": "#a9cbdf",
               "line-width": {"base": 1.4, "stops": [[13, 0.4], [16, 1.2], [19, 2.5]]}}},

    {"id": "boundary-county", "type": "line", "source-layer": "boundary", "minzoom": 8.5, "maxzoom": 13,
     "filter": ["==", "admin_level", 6],
     "paint": {"line-color": "#c2bccf", "line-width": {"stops": [[8.5, 0.6], [13, 1]]},
               "line-dasharray": [3, 2]}},
    {"id": "boundary-state", "type": "line", "source-layer": "boundary",
     "filter": ["==", "admin_level", 4],
     "paint": {"line-color": "#a39bb8", "line-width": {"stops": [[3, 0.7], [7, 1.4], [12, 2.2]]},
               "line-dasharray": [4, 2]}},
    {"id": "boundary-country", "type": "line", "source-layer": "boundary",
     "filter": ["==", "admin_level", 2],
     "paint": {"line-color": "#8f86a8", "line-width": {"stops": [[0, 0.8], [6, 1.6], [12, 2.6]]}}},

    {"id": "building", "type": "fill", "source-layer": "building", "minzoom": 14.5,
     "paint": {"fill-color": "#e2ddd5",
               "fill-outline-color": {"stops": [[14.5, "#e2ddd5"], [15.5, "#cfc8bd"]]}}},

    {"id": "aeroway-runway", "type": "line", "source-layer": "aeroway", "minzoom": 11,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "runway"]],
     "paint": {"line-color": "#d4d0da", "line-width": {"base": 1.5, "stops": [[11, 1], [14, 6], [17, 30]]}}},

    {"id": "rail", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 10,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["in", "class", "rail", "transit"], ["!=", "brunnel", "tunnel"]],
     "paint": {"line-color": "#9e9a93", "line-width": {"base": 1.4, "stops": [[10, 0.6], [14, 1.6], [18, 3]]}}},
    {"id": "rail-hatch", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 14,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["in", "class", "rail", "transit"], ["!=", "brunnel", "tunnel"]],
     "paint": {"line-color": "#f2efe9", "line-width": {"base": 1.4, "stops": [[14, 0.6], [18, 1.6]]},
               "line-dasharray": [3, 3]}},
    {"id": "rail-tunnel", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 13,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["in", "class", "rail", "transit"], ["==", "brunnel", "tunnel"]],
     "paint": {"line-color": "#b9b4ad", "line-width": {"stops": [[13, 0.8], [18, 2]]},
               "line-dasharray": [2, 2]}},

    {"_comment": "Casings carry the tier colour and are drawn below every fill, so junctions stay whole. Below the zoom where a fill starts, the casing alone is the road.",
     "id": "road-driveway-casing", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 16.5,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "service"], ["in", "service", "driveway", "parking_aisle"]],
     "paint": {"line-color": "#d8d3ca", "line-width": {"base": 1.5, "stops": [[16.5, 2], [19, 6]]}}},
    {"id": "road-service-casing", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 14,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "service"], ["!in", "service", "driveway", "parking_aisle"]],
     "paint": {"line-color": "#a9c4b0", "line-width": {"base": 1.5, "stops": [[14, 1], [16, 3], [19, 9]]}}},
    {"id": "road-quiet-casing", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 12,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "minor"]],
     "paint": {"line-color": "#8fb89a", "line-width": {"base": 1.5, "stops": [[12, 0.7], [13, 1.5], [14, 2.4], [16, 5.5], [19, 16]]}}},
    {"id": "road-moderate-casing", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 11,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "tertiary"]],
     "paint": {"line-color": {"stops": [[11, "#d9c79e"], [12, "#e0a830"]]},
               "line-width": {"base": 1.5, "stops": [[11, 0.7], [13, 3], [16, 8], [19, 20]]}}},
    {"id": "road-busy-casing", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 9,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "secondary"]],
     "paint": {"line-color": {"stops": [[9, "#d4c2a8"], [11, "#e07b39"]]},
               "line-width": {"base": 1.5, "stops": [[9, 0.6], [11, 1.6], [13, 3.5], [16, 9], [19, 22]]}}},
    {"id": "road-avoid-casing", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 7,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["in", "class", "primary", "trunk"]],
     "paint": {"line-color": {"stops": [[7, "#cdb9a5"], [10, "#c8413a"]]},
               "line-width": {"base": 1.5, "stops": [[7, 0.5], [9, 1], [11, 2], [13, 4], [16, 10], [19, 24]]}}},
    {"id": "road-nobike-casing", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 12,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["in", "class", "primary", "trunk", "secondary", "tertiary", "minor", "service"], ["==", "bicycle", "no"]],
     "paint": {"line-color": "#7d7884", "line-width": {"base": 1.5, "stops": [[12, 1], [13, 3.5], [16, 9], [19, 22]]}}},
    {"id": "road-signed-casing", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 12,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["in", "class", "primary", "trunk", "secondary", "tertiary", "minor", "service"], ["==", "bicycle", "designated"]],
     "paint": {"line-color": "#2e9e57", "line-width": {"base": 1.5, "stops": [[12, 1], [13, 3.5], [16, 9], [19, 22]]}}},
    {"_comment": "Interstates are drawn from z5 as orientation landmarks: indigo, the one hue no riding tier uses.",
     "id": "road-interstate-casing", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 5,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "motorway"]],
     "paint": {"line-color": "#463f7a",
               "line-width": {"base": 1.5, "stops": [[5, 1.2], [8, 2.2], [10, 3.2], [13, 6], [16, 13], [19, 30]]}}},

    {"id": "road-driveway", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 16.5,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "service"], ["in", "service", "driveway", "parking_aisle"]],
     "paint": {"line-color": "#fbf9f5", "line-width": {"base": 1.5, "stops": [[16.5, 1], [19, 4]]}}},
    {"id": "road-service", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 14,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "service"], ["!in", "service", "driveway", "parking_aisle"]],
     "paint": {"line-color": "#ffffff", "line-width": {"base": 1.5, "stops": [[14, 0.5], [16, 1.8], [19, 7]]}}},
    {"id": "road-quiet", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 13.5,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "minor"]],
     "paint": {"line-color": "#ffffff", "line-width": {"base": 1.5, "stops": [[13.5, 0.7], [14, 1.1], [16, 3.8], [19, 13]]}}},
    {"id": "road-moderate", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 12.5,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "tertiary"]],
     "paint": {"line-color": "#fff6dc", "line-width": {"base": 1.5, "stops": [[12.5, 0.8], [13, 1.8], [16, 5.5], [19, 16]]}}},
    {"id": "road-busy", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 12,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "secondary"]],
     "paint": {"line-color": "#ffeedf", "line-width": {"base": 1.5, "stops": [[12, 0.8], [13, 2.2], [16, 6.5], [19, 18]]}}},
    {"id": "road-avoid", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 12,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["in", "class", "primary", "trunk"]],
     "paint": {"line-color": "#fde3dd", "line-width": {"base": 1.5, "stops": [[12, 1], [13, 2.6], [16, 7.5], [19, 20]]}}},
    {"id": "road-interstate", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 8.5,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "motorway"]],
     "paint": {"line-color": "#f6e4d0",
               "line-width": {"base": 1.5, "stops": [[8.5, 0.8], [10, 1.8], [13, 4], [16, 10], [19, 26]]}}},

    {"_comment": "Draws only on tiles whose profile writes `cycleway` (lane, buffered_lane, shared_lane, track); today's peregrine profile does not, and the layer is then empty.",
     "id": "bike-lane", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 13,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["in", "cycleway", "lane", "buffered_lane", "track", "separate", "opposite_lane", "opposite_track"]],
     "paint": {"line-color": "#2e9e57", "line-width": {"base": 1.4, "stops": [[13, 0.8], [16, 2], [19, 4]]},
               "line-dasharray": [3, 1.5]}},

    {"id": "track", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 13,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "track"], ["!in", "bicycle", "yes", "designated", "permissive"]],
     "paint": {"line-color": "#a88d64", "line-width": {"stops": [[13, 0.8], [18, 2.5]]},
               "line-dasharray": [3, 2]}},
    {"_comment": "Sidewalks and crossings are class=path subclass=footway. They cannot be ridden here, so they wait until the map is close enough to show a block's edge.",
     "id": "sidewalk", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 16.5,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "path"], ["in", "subclass", "footway", "pedestrian"],
                ["!in", "bicycle", "yes", "designated", "permissive"], ["!has", "golf"]],
     "paint": {"line-color": "#b7a99a", "line-width": {"stops": [[16.5, 0.6], [19, 1.8]]},
               "line-dasharray": [2, 1.5]}},
    {"id": "steps", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 16,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "path"], ["==", "subclass", "steps"]],
     "paint": {"line-color": "#9a5b44", "line-width": {"stops": [[16, 2], [19, 5]]},
               "line-dasharray": [0.4, 0.4]}},
    {"_comment": "Walking trails: generic paths and bridleways that do not admit bicycles. Unlike sidewalks they run through parks and are worth seeing from z14.",
     "id": "walk", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 14,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "path"], ["in", "subclass", "path", "bridleway"],
                ["!in", "bicycle", "yes", "designated", "permissive"], ["!has", "golf"]],
     "paint": {"line-color": "#9a6b4b", "line-width": {"base": 1.3, "stops": [[14, 0.8], [16, 1.6], [19, 3.5]]},
               "line-dasharray": [2.5, 1.5]}},

    {"_comment": "Trails: highway=cycleway, and any path or track that admits bicycles. The strongest line on the map; a pale core from z14, dashed where unpaved.",
     "id": "trail-casing", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 10.5,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["in", "class", "path", "track"],
                ["any", ["==", "subclass", "cycleway"], ["in", "bicycle", "yes", "designated", "permissive"]],
                ["!in", "surface", "unpaved", "gravel", "fine_gravel", "compacted", "dirt", "earth", "ground", "grass", "mud", "sand", "woodchips"]],
     "paint": {"line-color": "#17803d",
               "line-width": {"base": 1.4, "stops": [[10.5, 0.8], [13, 2], [16, 4.5], [19, 9]]}}},
    {"id": "trail-unpaved", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 12,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["in", "class", "path", "track"],
                ["any", ["==", "subclass", "cycleway"], ["in", "bicycle", "yes", "designated", "permissive"]],
                ["in", "surface", "unpaved", "gravel", "fine_gravel", "compacted", "dirt", "earth", "ground", "grass", "mud", "sand", "woodchips"]],
     "paint": {"line-color": "#5f8a2e",
               "line-width": {"base": 1.4, "stops": [[12, 1], [16, 3], [19, 6]]},
               "line-dasharray": [2, 1]}},
    {"id": "trail", "type": "line", "source-layer": "transportation", "minzoom": 14,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["in", "class", "path", "track"],
                ["any", ["==", "subclass", "cycleway"], ["in", "bicycle", "yes", "designated", "permissive"]],
                ["!in", "surface", "unpaved", "gravel", "fine_gravel", "compacted", "dirt", "earth", "ground", "grass", "mud", "sand", "woodchips"]],
     "paint": {"line-color": "#e3f5e7",
               "line-width": {"base": 1.4, "stops": [[14, 0.8], [16, 2], [19, 4.5]]}}},

    {"id": "barrier", "type": "circle", "source-layer": "poi", "minzoom": 17,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "Point"], ["==", "class", "barrier"]],
     "paint": {"circle-color": "#5a5046", "circle-radius": {"stops": [[17, 2], [19, 3.5]]}}},

    {"id": "water-name", "type": "symbol", "source-layer": "water_name", "minzoom": 14,
     "filter": ["==", "$type", "Point"],
     "layout": {"text-field": "{name:latin}", "text-size": 10.5},
     "paint": {"text-color": "#3b6f90", "text-halo-color": "#e2f0f7", "text-halo-width": 1.2}},
    {"id": "river-name", "type": "symbol", "source-layer": "waterway", "minzoom": 12,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "river"]],
     "layout": {"text-field": "{name:latin}", "symbol-placement": "line", "symbol-spacing": 500,
                "text-size": {"stops": [[12, 10], [16, 12.5]]}},
     "paint": {"text-color": "#3b6f90", "text-halo-color": "#e2f0f7", "text-halo-width": 1.2}},

    {"id": "road-name-minor", "type": "symbol", "source-layer": "transportation_name", "minzoom": 15.5,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["in", "class", "minor", "service"]],
     "layout": {"text-field": "{name:latin}", "symbol-placement": "line", "symbol-spacing": 350,
                "text-size": {"stops": [[15.5, 9.5], [19, 13]]}},
     "paint": {"text-color": "#4f4a44", "text-halo-color": "#ffffff", "text-halo-width": 1.5}},
    {"id": "road-name-major", "type": "symbol", "source-layer": "transportation_name", "minzoom": 13.5,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["in", "class", "tertiary", "secondary", "primary", "trunk"]],
     "layout": {"text-field": "{name:latin}", "symbol-placement": "line", "symbol-spacing": 450,
                "text-size": {"stops": [[13.5, 10], [16, 11.5], [19, 15]]}},
     "paint": {"text-color": "#3e3830", "text-halo-color": "#fffaf3", "text-halo-width": 1.8}},
    {"id": "trail-name", "type": "symbol", "source-layer": "transportation_name", "minzoom": 13.5,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "path"], ["==", "subclass", "cycleway"]],
     "layout": {"text-field": "{name:latin}", "symbol-placement": "line", "symbol-spacing": 400,
                "text-offset": [0, 0.9], "text-size": {"stops": [[13.5, 10], [16, 11.5], [19, 13]]}},
     "paint": {"text-color": "#145f2f", "text-halo-color": "#f7fbf5", "text-halo-width": 1.7}},
    {"id": "path-name", "type": "symbol", "source-layer": "transportation_name", "minzoom": 16.5,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "path"], ["!=", "subclass", "cycleway"]],
     "layout": {"text-field": "{name:latin}", "symbol-placement": "line", "symbol-spacing": 300,
                "text-offset": [0, 0.9], "text-size": {"stops": [[16.5, 9.5], [19, 12]]}},
     "paint": {"text-color": "#7a4630", "text-halo-color": "#fbf8f1", "text-halo-width": 1.5}},
    {"_comment": "Route numbers in white on an indigo halo read as a shield; the sheet has no shield artwork.",
     "id": "interstate-ref", "type": "symbol", "source-layer": "transportation_name", "minzoom": 8,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "LineString"], ["==", "class", "motorway"]],
     "layout": {"text-field": "{ref}", "symbol-placement": "line", "symbol-spacing": 500,
                "text-size": {"stops": [[8, 9.5], [12, 11], [16, 13]]}},
     "paint": {"text-color": "#ffffff", "text-halo-color": "#463f7a", "text-halo-width": 2.4}},

    {"_comment": "Lodging, parking and food share z16.5 so all three are on a phone's map by 1:5,000.",
     "id": "poi-lodging", "type": "symbol", "source-layer": "poi", "minzoom": 16.5,
     "filter": ["all", ["==", "$type", "Point"], ["==", "class", "lodging"]],
     "layout": {"icon-image": "lodging_11", "text-field": "{name:latin}", "text-size": 10,
